@host = http://localhost:5160
@authToken = <your-jwt-token-here>
@zoneUid = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 1. Obtener todas las zonas de escalada
GET {{host}}/api/climbZone
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Obtener una zona por UID
GET {{host}}/api/climbZone/{{zoneUid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Crear una zona de escalada
POST {{host}}/api/climbZone
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rocódromo Central",
  "description": "Rocódromo indoor con paredes de hasta 15m",
  "isPublic": true,
  "isIndoor": true,
  "imageUrl": null,
  "organizationId": 1
}

###

### 4. Actualizar una zona
PUT {{host}}/api/climbZone/{{zoneUid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rocódromo Central - Renovado",
  "description": "Descripción actualizada tras renovación",
  "isPublic": true,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/zona.jpg",
  "organizationId": 1
}

###

### 5. Eliminar una zona
DELETE {{host}}/api/climbZone/{{zoneUid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###
